  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "So I know a lot of people use a pc to record them. However not everyone has that ability to do that. Some may not have the time and patience to deal with it in obs studio, and not exactly all of us have a pc vr or just a pc in general. And questies only can record with the plain square screen recording unless recording from the app on mobile or a laptop. Which in my opinion isn't great. Issue is If we move our head the screen recording moves too. And honestly it's annoying to see the camera move around so much because we move our heads. Another thing is for questies, some of us aren't able to record because of lags. Trust me it gets annoying. So maybe consider a recording option added onto the camera.",
